# Docs Directory

This folder contains all project documentation for Swrly / AGlancer.

## Structure

| Folder / File | Owner | Purpose |
|---|---|---|
| `scribe/` | Scribe (agent) | Live project documents: summaries, workstreams, decisions, roadmap |
| `brand/` | Design | JSX mockups — UI sample and API schema reference |
| `migrations/` | Forge / Engineering | Numbered SQL migration files |
| `setup/` | Engineering | Deployment, environment, and integration setup guides |
| `architecture/` | Atlas / Forge | Technical architecture, system design, team topology |
| `planning/` | Team | New project playbooks, ideal flows, agent assignments |

## Where Scribe writes

All documents created or maintained by Scribe go into **`docs/scribe/`**.

The `DOCS_PATH` environment variable controls the base path (default: `/app/docs`).
Scribe's subfolder resolves to `$DOCS_PATH/scribe/`.

## Existing root-level docs

The files currently at the docs root are legacy; they will be migrated into
the folders above as they are next updated by their owners.